Package: rust-connect
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Maintainer: George Larson <georgeglarson@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/georgeglarson/rust-connect
Description: A modern, API-first reimplementation of KDE Connect in Rust
 Rust Connect provides device discovery, pairing, and plugin-based
 communication with KDE Connect-compatible Android devices. It exposes
 a REST API and an SSE event stream for integration.
 .
 Protocol ports: TCP/UDP 1716
 API port: TCP 9090
